{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Hey Nate, hi! Yesterday, I tried my newest dairy-free recipe and it was a winner with my family! Mixing and matching flavors is fun and I'm always trying new things. How about you?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-d536fc82ed45625727f329d5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:41.961346+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d536fc82ed45625727f329d5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d536fc82ed45625727f329d5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hey Joanna! That tart looks yummy! Lately, I've been doing great - I won a really big video game tournament last week and it was awesome! I still can't believe I made so much money from it."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-fd6fb38e347fb886dc883e99", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:41.982805+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fd6fb38e347fb886dc883e99", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fd6fb38e347fb886dc883e99", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Way to go, Nate! Winning the tournament and earning cash is awesome - congrats! Did you save it for something special?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-28407012f9f8a79ee2201f2d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:41.996480+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "28407012f9f8a79ee2201f2d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "28407012f9f8a79ee2201f2d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Thanks Joanna! Yeah, I saved some but I'm not sure what to do with it - I'm completely content already. I don't have big plans anyway, so it's nice to have the extra cash on hand."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-6ef25b06d1ea9a199933cd7f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.007605+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6ef25b06d1ea9a199933cd7f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6ef25b06d1ea9a199933cd7f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: That's awesome, Nate! Having some extra cash on hand definitely brings a sense of freedom and relaxation, huh?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-c7fe874984746adc4debb0a8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.020883+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c7fe874984746adc4debb0a8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c7fe874984746adc4debb0a8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Yes! Finally, I don't have to stress about it, so I can just enjoy my movies and games."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-2a7936d5b0dbcbcfb5101ebe", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.030998+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2a7936d5b0dbcbcfb5101ebe", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2a7936d5b0dbcbcfb5101ebe", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Taking breaks and reducing stress is pretty nice! Have you watched any good movies recently? I could use some recommendations!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-0ae423dcacf873ccd09d88a5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.042359+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0ae423dcacf873ccd09d88a5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0ae423dcacf873ccd09d88a5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I watched \"Little Women\" recently, and it was great! The acting was awesome and the story was so captivating. Definitely a good one!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-48826da958abe52b77fb043f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.053363+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "48826da958abe52b77fb043f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "48826da958abe52b77fb043f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I'm so glad you enjoyed it! I recommended it to you a while back. I watched it too and it really spoke to me. Themes like sisterhood, love, and chasing dreams were explored so well. By the way, I finished up my writing for my book last week. Put in a ton of late nights and edits but finally got it done. I'm so proud of it! Can't wait to see what happens next."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-baf3bad449f43e690746bd7a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.063662+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "baf3bad449f43e690746bd7a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "baf3bad449f43e690746bd7a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Way to go! We both know it took some effort, but I'm sure it'll be great. Congrats on finishing it up!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-b9c3f76a25263e2f7ad80eda", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.081015+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b9c3f76a25263e2f7ad80eda", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b9c3f76a25263e2f7ad80eda", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks Nate! Your words mean a lot. Dedication and late nights got me here, but it was worth it. Just like you with your recent tournament - hard work pays off. I appreciate your support throughout!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-d08f3386b8e6b353482fae15", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.092753+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d08f3386b8e6b353482fae15", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d08f3386b8e6b353482fae15", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I'm always here for you, Joanna! You've worked so hard and accomplished a lot \u2013 I'm proud. Keep on going!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-b44c1e3333ce720f2fb20745", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.105042+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b44c1e3333ce720f2fb20745", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b44c1e3333ce720f2fb20745", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! I won't give up on my goals as long as your here to support me."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-1340dd2d077e21532e14cd73", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.117042+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1340dd2d077e21532e14cd73", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1340dd2d077e21532e14cd73", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: You can always count on me! I even made this for you!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-9799d04442dda3dc80d83523", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.130357+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9799d04442dda3dc80d83523", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9799d04442dda3dc80d83523", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Wow, Nate, that looks awesome! What inspired you?"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-c903f6eed42468526fdf7ac7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.139559+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c903f6eed42468526fdf7ac7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c903f6eed42468526fdf7ac7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I figured you could always look back on this whenever you need encouragement, and that was all the inspiration I needed. And I would also say that your life path can be quite inspirational!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-c7bd839a07bee9e55513e47b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.147687+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c7bd839a07bee9e55513e47b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c7bd839a07bee9e55513e47b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Wow, Nate! That's sweet of you! I'll make sure to remember this when I need the encouragement the most."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-21f57ef17f94367354926e99", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.159946+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "21f57ef17f94367354926e99", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "21f57ef17f94367354926e99", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Awesome! I know encouragement is what got me so far in my gameing career, so I figured why not share the love."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-0f2d8919542546d7d28e7e61", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.168949+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0f2d8919542546d7d28e7e61", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0f2d8919542546d7d28e7e61", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Rest assured, it will be something I cherish! On another note, I just finished this cute little bookmark for one of the ladies at my writing club!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-62f16cbade96058f6b2c1914", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.180094+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "62f16cbade96058f6b2c1914", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "62f16cbade96058f6b2c1914", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: That bookmark is great. I'm sure she'll love it!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-a868de008a61f062b22a610f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.193145+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a868de008a61f062b22a610f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a868de008a61f062b22a610f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks Nate! I absolutley love DIYs, and I know she does too."}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-592e5a85688e72c7d1497a5b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.203150+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "592e5a85688e72c7d1497a5b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "592e5a85688e72c7d1497a5b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Let me know how it goes!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-b6f0b7f02957dd9faa8c11b8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.212501+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b6f0b7f02957dd9faa8c11b8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b6f0b7f02957dd9faa8c11b8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Sure thing! Bye for now!"}, "creation_event": "selection-policy-ingest-3.3-SELECTION-POLICY-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-42/session_22-2bc45652f6c2b3a3b312f214", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T14:10:42.222156+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2bc45652f6c2b3a3b312f214", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2bc45652f6c2b3a3b312f214", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
